Upstream credit chain (informational)
-------------------------------------

Adafruit's driver is itself adapted from Pololu's Arduino VL53L0X library:

    https://github.com/pololu/vl53l0x-arduino

The sensor initialization and tuning register sequence ultimately derives from
ST Microelectronics' VL53L0X API (STSW-IMG005); some register names and
explanatory comments originate in ST's API source, API user manual (UM2039),
and the VL53L0X datasheet. These attributions are carried forward here in
keeping with the upstream projects.
